 - `customers.add_customer(name, tier="standard")`: create a customer
 - `customers.outstanding_balance(customer_id)`: total of the customer's open invoices
+- `customers.lock_customer(customer_id)`: set the customer's `locked` flag to True and return the customer (not a list). Raises `E_NOT_FOUND` if the customer does not exist. Emits `customer.locked` when the flag changes. Idempotent: locking an already-locked customer returns it unchanged with no event.
 
